WEBVTT

1
00:00:34,830 --> 00:00:35,830
Commander, be careful

2
00:00:35,830 --> 00:00:42,110
Don't you want to retreat?

3
00:00:42,110 --> 00:00:43,110
Why don't you move?

4
00:00:43,110 --> 00:00:47,190
Isn't it spying on information?

5
00:00:47,190 --> 00:00:49,380
That's how he spies

6
00:00:49,380 --> 00:00:57,410
Pick one hundred of these

7
00:00:57,410 --> 00:00:58,410
I didn't expect it either

8
00:00:58,410 --> 00:01:01,410
One day we will be able to gather information like this

9
00:01:01,410 --> 00:01:02,410
Should we go down?

10
00:01:02,410 --> 00:01:04,410
I see that the new recruits are about to be killed.

11
00:01:04,410 --> 00:01:06,600
Go on

12
00:01:06,600 --> 00:01:11,540
I remember my mission

13
00:01:11,540 --> 00:01:12,540
The last one

14
00:01:12,540 --> 00:01:14,540
Let the commander spy on the information.
